[5.975982,"o","Dustin plan  (re-read for execution: nothing is signed before you confirm)\r\r\nNetwork      testnet   ledger 5,142,063   observed 2026-10-11T15:51:42Z\r\r\nAccount      GBBKY67KWLD2C4A3OC75HKBFGGVJPZ3LDVG7ADG3UJGJS5CADG5KPRIS\r\r\nBalance      4.0000000 XLM, minimum balance 4.0000000 XLM, spendable 0.0000000 XLM (base reserve 0.5000000)\r\r\nDestination  GB2TXR47ONIZYQBNQKM6GIQNMJEDQUMYMDPKQ4OPAXR2K36E4NXOCUR2\r\r\nSponsor      GCEQT6KAZRFJUOUTIG4T7ARJ3YYKT2ZVCZGPUI2PXEDBWMO6QIN7YH2Q\r\r\nFees         bid up to 0.1740120 XLM (116,008 stroops per operation), paid by the sponsor; the account pays 0\r\r\nBudget       5.0000000 XLM per close for the sponsor; the bid above is within it\r\r\nStatus       CLOSABLE: the plan ends in a merge\r\r\n\r\r\nSteps, in execution order\r\r\n  S01  tx 1  cancel offer 912042: sells 0.0000002 DUSTA for XLM\r\r\n             why: Open offer 912042 sells 0.0000002 DUSTA for XLM. Offers are subentries that block the merge, and their\r\r\n             liabilities stop the balance from moving and the trustline from being removed; it is cancelled with amount\r\r\n             0.\r\r\n  S02  tx 1  cancel offer 912043: sells 0.0000002 DUSTC for DUSTB\r\r\n             why: Open offer 912043 sells 0.0000002 DUSTC for DUSTB. Offers are subentries that block the merge, and\r\r\n             their liabilities stop the balance from moving and the trustline from being removed; it is cancelled with\r\r\n             amount 0.\r\r\n  S03  tx 1  return 0.0000003 DUSTB to issuer GB7D...MF25 (burn)\r\r\n             why: Horizon found no strict-send path to XLM for the full balance. Pay the 0.0000003 DUSTB back to its\r\r\n             issuer GB7DDOZXJNLCZVVMVPEVNARYKLKSMLB7ML25CX3XMCDTGA5QTVXBMF25, which burns it.\r\r\n  S04  tx 1  remove trustline DUSTB\r\r\n             why: The DUSTB trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks\r\r\n             the merge. Removing it (limit 0) releases its 0.5 XLM reserve to this account.\r\r\n  S05  tx 1  return 0.0000005 DUSTC to issuer GB7D...MF25 (burn)\r\r\n             why: Horizon found no strict-send path to XLM for the full balance. Pay the 0.0000005 DUSTC back to its\r\r\n             issuer GB7DDOZXJNLCZVVMVPEVNARYKLKSMLB7ML25CX3XMCDTGA5QTVXBMF25, which burns it.\r\r\n  S06  tx 1  remove trustline DUSTC\r\r\n             why: The DUSTC trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks\r\r\n             the merge. Removing it (limit 0) releases its 0.5 XLM reserve to this account.\r\r\n  S07  tx 1  return 0.0000001 SPTA to issuer GB7D...MF25 (burn)\r\r\n             why: Horizon found no strict-send path to XLM for the full balance. Pay the 0.0000001 SPTA back to its\r\r\n             issuer GB7DDOZXJNLCZVVMVPEVNARYKLKSMLB7ML25CX3XMCDTGA5QTVXBMF25, which burns it.\r\r\n  S08  tx 1  remove trustline SPTA (reserve sponsored by GCQ6...WJLD)\r\r\n             why: The SPTA trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks the\r\r\n             merge. Removing it (limit 0) needs only this account's signature and returns its 0.5 XLM reserve to the\r\r\n             reserve sponsor GCQ6TUXC5C34UAF5URD6BWDDLP6V7J6MOSXWRT7NW36HP775MOFCWJLD, not to this account.\r\r\n  S09  tx 1  delete data entry \"dustin.fixture\"\r\r\n             why: Data entry \"dustin.fixture\" is a subentry that blocks the merge; a manage-data operation without a\r\r\n             value deletes it.\r\r\n  S10  tx 2  sell 0.0000007 DUSTA for XLM: path payment, quote 0.0000007, at least 0.0000006\r\r\n             why: Sell the full 0.0000007 DUSTA for about 0.0000007 XLM (at least 0.0000006) with a strict-send path\r\r\n             payment to this account; the XLM leaves with the merge. It runs in its own transaction so a moved market\r\r\n             cannot roll back the rest.\r\r\n  S11  tx 2  remove trustline DUSTA\r\r\n             why: The DUSTA trustline is empty once the balance is disposed of; a trustline is a subentry that blocks\r\r\n             the merge. Removing it (limit 0) releases its 0.5 XLM reserve to this account.\r\r\n  S12  tx 3  merge into GB2T...CUR2 (cannot be undone)\r\r\n             why: Eve"]
